  description:
  - The High Impact Stream Shooter was designed by the Tinkerer, allowing a more
    efficient and long range application of pressurized hydration.
  - Charging the gun will utilize its lock-on ability, allowing it to water multiple
    tiles at the cost of a single shot. Additionally, shots fired over a large distance
    have a larger splash radius.
  leftText: 
  rightText: This knife can be used to perform a quick 3 hit combo, with the finishing
    stab dealing more damage. It can also be thrown, resulting in hitting with either
    the hilt or the blade. The longer the distance traveled, the more likely the
    blade will connect. Even if the kukri is lost, it always finds a way of making
    its back to its owner.
